    </div>
    <div class="mistake">
      <div class="mistake__num">05</div>
      <div>
        <div class="mistake__title">Over-explaining</div>
        <p>Ask a question.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Pick one route, finish one project and show it to two people in the field. Then read ten live notices and apply or pitch a small client.
  </p>
  <p>
    A specialist can look at your strengths, finances and goals with you. A sensible first step is <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/student-career-guidance/">student career guidance</a>. The aim is a high-income skill portfolio and an earlier path to financial freedom.
  </p>

  <p>
    For a role-play drill for objections, read <a href="/blog/skills/how-to-improve-sales-and-negotiation-skills-india/">how to improve sales and negotiation skills</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For what a training day looks like and how to start, read <a href="/blog/career-options/soft-skills-trainer-career-india/">soft skills trainer careers</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For five habits and where paid courses mislead, read <a href="/blog/skills/personality-development-course-for-students-india/">personality development</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For team roles and a calm conflict routine, read <a href="/blog/skills/teamwork-skills-examples-and-how-to-build-them-india/">teamwork skills</a>.
  </p>

